        <blockquote class="testi-quote">
          "Excellent taste and premium quality."
        </blockquote>
        <p class="testi-detail">
          Our kids and grandparents all love these laddus. Knowing there is zero refined sugar and authentic Desi ghee makes it a daily guilt-free staple.
        </p>
        <div class="testi-author">
          <div class="testi-avatar av-1">PS</div>
